# Runtime artifacts. If this repo is deployed by placing it AT /ccagent on
# a turtle or host computer (see README > Install), these are the paths
# that fill up with the operator's own data at runtime and must never be
# committed: saved/registered routines and the state that tracks them.
/jobs/*.lua
/jobs/index.json

# The API key and turtle state (position, world memory, checkpoints) live
# outside this tree by design -- /.ccagent/key and /.ccagent/state.json,
# one level up from /ccagent -- so they cannot land here even by accident.
# This entry only guards against someone reconfiguring config.lua paths to
# point back inside the repo.
/.ccagent/

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Lua tooling, if a contributor adds any
*.luac
luacov.*.out
luacov.report.out
